sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Invoice as Invoice
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Invoice: recordRefund(refundAmount, paymentId)
    Note over Invoice: Policies: invoiceRead, invoiceWrite, invoiceExecute
    Note over Invoice: Guards (2)
    Invoice->>Invoice: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;paid#quot; or self.status == #quot;partial#quot;
    Invoice->>Invoice: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Invoice->>Invoice: compute.nextPaid
    Invoice->>Invoice: compute.nextDue
    Invoice->>Invoice: mutate.amountPaid
    Invoice->>Invoice: mutate.amountDue
    Invoice->>Invoice: mutate.status
    Invoice->>Invoice: mutate.paidAt
    Invoice->>EventBus: emit InvoiceRefundRecorded on invoice.refund_recorded
    Invoice-->>-Client: void